@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@apiKey =
@requestId = 9d0df985-610c-4e54-8d50-519e972a42a6
@uploadId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### Upload a product catalog JSON file
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/uploads
Idempotency-Key: {{requestId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=UploadBoundary

--UploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="ProductEntry.json"
Content-Type: application/json

< ./ProductEntry.json
--UploadBoundary--

### Public upload history (no API key)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/uploads?page=1&pageSize=25

### Persisted status and ordered items (set uploadId from acceptance response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/uploads/{{uploadId}}/status?page=1&pageSize=50

### Immutable report (409 until finalization)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/uploads/{{uploadId}}/report

### Canonical catalog and seller offers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog?category=Electronics&brand=Samsung&name=Galaxy&page=1&pageSize=25

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### Storage/database readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ready
